# Per-stage overrides for SWARM_ENV=test (NON-secret, committed).
#
# The `test` role (ADR-14: ephemeral, hermetic, CI, wiped every run) mostly runs
# via `mix test` directly on the host against `swarm/dev/docker-compose.yml`
# (which already defaults its own Postgres to `swarm_test`) — it does not need
# the full hive stack. This file exists for the rarer case of bringing up the
# FULL compose stack (kernel + ml + web_channel + keycloak) against a scratch
# `swarm_test` DB for manual integration checks. No overrides needed today —
# `env/base.env`'s defaults plus the derived `swarm_test` DB name are enough.
